## Coverage Requirements

- Минимальный coverage: **80%**
- Critical paths (auth, payments): **95%**

```bash
# Run tests with coverage
pnpm test --coverage

# Watch mode
pnpm test --watch
```

---

## What to Test

### MUST Test:
- [ ] Auth guards работают
- [ ] userId фильтрация работает
- [ ] Error handling (404, 403)
- [ ] Input validation (DTOs)

### SHOULD Test:
- [ ] Happy paths
- [ ] Edge cases
- [ ] Integration между modules

### DON'T Test:
- ❌ Prisma internals
- ❌ Third-party libraries
- ❌ Getters/setters
